{"vid":"xOa3BlJP5Xg","source":"xOa3BlJP5Xg.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":2.5,"txt":"You're learning with Nine to Five English. Business English for the workplace."},{"t":15.5,"txt":"Hi Tim here with another 9 to 5 English lesson. In today's lesson we're"},{"t":23.5,"txt":"going to learn how to talk about your ideas. You might be full of great ideas"},{"t":30.8,"txt":"about your company your products or how to connect with your customers but those"},{"t":38.3,"txt":"ideas aren't very useful if you can't tell other people about the."},{"t":45.8,"txt":"You probably find yourself in lots of situations where you might talk about"},{"t":51.1,"txt":"your ideas. Think about a staff meeting or a business lunch everyone's talking"},{"t":58.7,"txt":"about what the company should do and you've got a good idea. So do you just"},{"t":65.2,"txt":"shout it out for everyone to hear? No rather than just shouting out your idea"},{"t":73.3,"txt":"it's best to introduce it first. I mean you should tell everyone that you have"},{"t":80.9,"txt":"an idea you want to share. And you might say exactly that like I've got something"},{"t":89.3,"txt":"to share or you could say here's what I've been thinking or how about this?"},{"t":97.5,"txt":"These are just some of the ways that you can introduce your idea. How about"},{"t":105.3,"txt":"practicing some of these expressions? We're going to present some examples"},{"t":111.9,"txt":"after you hear each example try repeating it yourself. Ready? Let's give it a go!"},{"t":122.4,"txt":"How about this for an idea?"},{"t":129.5,"txt":"Here's what I've been thinking about."},{"t":137.6,"txt":"I've got something I'd like to share on this point."},{"t":146.8,"txt":"One way of looking at this would be to..."},{"t":156.4,"txt":"So we've just practiced some different ways of introducing an idea. Once you've"},{"t":163.5,"txt":"done that then people are prepared they are now listening to hear what you have"},{"t":170.7,"txt":"to say but you need to be a bit careful how you state your idea if you're not"},{"t":179.2,"txt":"the boss you'll need to avoid saying we have to or it is necessary for us to do"},{"t":188.3,"txt":"something in many situations that's too strong if you're just making a"},{"t":195.2,"txt":"suggestion then you need something softer one way of suggesting an idea is"},{"t":203.7,"txt":"saying we could that's a polite way to present your idea as one possibility so"},{"t":212.7,"txt":"in a marketing meeting you might say we could create some new TV ads there are"},{"t":221.2,"txt":"other ways of making suggestions using how about and what if for example you"},{"t":230.4,"txt":"could say how about creating some ads or what if we created some ads another"},{"t":239.7,"txt":"really simple way to present your idea is with the words I think for example"},{"t":247.2,"txt":"you might say I think we should lower our costs that's just a bit softer than"},{"t":254.3,"txt":"saying we should lower our costs which is to direct many people don't like to"},{"t":261.9,"txt":"hear ideas suggested that directly now it's your turn to try using these"},{"t":269,"txt":"expressions you'll hear some examples after each example repeat what you hear"},{"t":276.9,"txt":"let's begin we could hold a big promotional event"},{"t":284.2,"txt":"you"},{"t":288.8,"txt":"I think there are a few ways we could cut costs"},{"t":299.5,"txt":"what if we bought the building instead of renting it"},{"t":307.9,"txt":"why don't we make a mobile version of the website"},{"t":316.6,"txt":"as you heard to suggest an idea sometimes we ask a question that shows"},{"t":325,"txt":"that we are open to what other people think after all you're not giving orders"},{"t":331.6,"txt":"rather you're trying to get people to think your idea is a good one so it's"},{"t":340.9,"txt":"important simply to ask them what they think about it you might ask an entire"},{"t":347.1,"txt":"group of people by saying how does everyone feel about that or anyone have"},{"t":354.4,"txt":"any thoughts on this you might also ask one person to respond with something"},{"t":361.3,"txt":"like what's your view on this Betty one more simple way to ask what people think"},{"t":369.2,"txt":"about an idea is with the question how does that sound and do you notice in"},{"t":376.3,"txt":"this and the other expressions I've given you that we say this or that to"},{"t":384.9,"txt":"refer to the idea using these words is better than saying my idea or asking do"},{"t":394,"txt":"you agree with me why is saying this better than saying my"},{"t":401,"txt":"idea well because you want people to focus on the idea not on whose idea it"},{"t":409.9,"txt":"is if you say me and my a lot people might feel you are thinking about"},{"t":417.7,"txt":"yourself too much let's practice using these expressions for asking what people"},{"t":425.7,"txt":"think about your ideas remember to repeat each example after you hear it"},{"t":434.2,"txt":"how does everyone feel about that"},{"t":442.7,"txt":"what's your view on this Dave"},{"t":450.1,"txt":"how does that sound"},{"t":457.1,"txt":"anyone have any on this"},{"t":464.8,"txt":"oK you've done some great practice with some useful expressions but how does"},{"t":471.5,"txt":"this sound in a conversation well let's listen to a short discussion between"},{"t":478.4,"txt":"Sandra and Kelly about a new office design looking at the office layout does"},{"t":487,"txt":"anyone have any ideas yes I've got something I'd like to share on this sure"},{"t":493.4,"txt":"go ahead well what if we put another meeting room"},{"t":497.5,"txt":"on the second floor can you see how that worked"},{"t":502.9,"txt":"Sandra says she's got something to share about the office layout then once"},{"t":510.4,"txt":"everyone's listening she makes a suggestion"},{"t":514.2,"txt":"using a what if question now it's your turn to practice will repeat the"},{"t":522.6,"txt":"dialogue but this time we're going to beep out Sandra's words you will have to"},{"t":529.8,"txt":"say those parts yourself remember first you'll say that you have something to"},{"t":536.2,"txt":"share and then you'll suggest putting another meeting room on the second floor"},{"t":545,"txt":"looking at the office layout does anyone have any ideas"},{"t":554.4,"txt":"you"},{"t":557.9,"txt":"sure go ahead"},{"t":564.5,"txt":"you"},{"t":567.8,"txt":"all right so we've learned some great ways to talk about your ideas and to ask"},{"t":575.5,"txt":"what other people think about your ideas in our next lesson we'll learn about how"},{"t":582.8,"txt":"to agree with other people's ideas until then so long and happy learning"}],"words":[{"t":2.48,"w":"You're"},{"t":2.48,"w":"learning"},{"t":2.48,"w":"with"},{"t":2.48,"w":"Nine"},{"t":2.48,"w":"to"},{"t":2.48,"w":"Five"},{"t":2.48,"w":"English."},{"t":2.48,"w":"Business"},{"t":2.48,"w":"English"},{"t":2.48,"w":"for"},{"t":2.48,"w":"the"},{"t":2.48,"w":"workplace."},{"t":15.5,"w":"Hi"},{"t":15.5,"w":"Tim"},{"t":15.5,"w":"here"},{"t":15.5,"w":"with"},{"t":15.5,"w":"another"},{"t":15.5,"w":"9"},{"t":15.5,"w":"to"},{"t":15.5,"w":"5"},{"t":15.5,"w":"English"},{"t":15.5,"w":"lesson."},{"t":15.5,"w":"In"},{"t":15.5,"w":"today's"},{"t":15.5,"w":"lesson"},{"t":15.5,"w":"we're"},{"t":23.49,"w":"going"},{"t":23.49,"w":"to"},{"t":23.49,"w":"learn"},{"t":23.49,"w":"how"},{"t":23.49,"w":"to"},{"t":23.49,"w":"talk"},{"t":23.49,"w":"about"},{"t":23.49,"w":"your"},{"t":23.49,"w":"ideas."},{"t":23.49,"w":"You"},{"t":23.49,"w":"might"},{"t":23.49,"w":"be"},{"t":23.49,"w":"full"},{"t":23.49,"w":"of"},{"t":23.49,"w":"great"},{"t":23.49,"w":"ideas"},{"t":30.84,"w":"about"},{"t":30.84,"w":"your"},{"t":30.84,"w":"company"},{"t":30.84,"w":"your"},{"t":30.84,"w":"products"},{"t":30.84,"w":"or"},{"t":30.84,"w":"how"},{"t":30.84,"w":"to"},{"t":30.84,"w":"connect"},{"t":30.84,"w":"with"},{"t":30.84,"w":"your"},{"t":30.84,"w":"customers"},{"t":30.84,"w":"but"},{"t":30.84,"w":"those"},{"t":38.34,"w":"ideas"},{"t":38.34,"w":"aren't"},{"t"